  "subject": "Four old friends play 32-tile tin-gau domino at a Lukang temple courtyard table and have used a bottle cap for the missing tile for twenty years, until the carpenter among them carves a replacement from an ebony chopstick.",
  "caption": "1990s Taiwanese Hokkien power ballad, slow rising arrangement in the Lim Chiang era. Clean chorus-tinged electric guitar arpeggios, slide-tinged lead guitar answering the vocal, tenor saxophone solo after the second chorus, Hammond organ pad, live drum kit with big snare and plate reverb, round electric bass. 1990s Taipei studio sheen. Male vocal, strong mid-range tenor, sincere rising delivery, clearly sung melody. Clear full voice, every word enunciated, steady sung melody on every line. 72 BPM, A minor. Warm, steadfast, gently teasing mood. No synth lead, no programmed trap drums, no autotune, no screaming guitars, no rap.",
  "lyrics": "[Verse]\n鹿港廟口，四个老朋友\n三十二塊的牌，賰三十一塊\n二十冬來，攏用一个瓶仔蓋\n補彼塊無去的牌\n[Pre-Chorus]\n阿財講，蓋仔毋是牌\n贏的人，攏毋敢共蓋仔拍\n[Chorus]\n骨牌拍落桌，聲真響\n少一塊，嘛會當拍\n二十冬的朋友，無欠啥\n只欠彼塊，等伊轉來\n[Verse]\n阿明做木工，暗暗仔彫\n一支烏木的箸，削做一塊牌\n六點閣六點，用針仔鑽\n點仔紅紅，用胭脂抹\n[Pre-Chorus]\n伊毋敢講，驚人笑\n放佇口袋底，三個月\n[Chorus]\n骨牌拍落桌，聲真響\n少一塊，嘛會當拍\n二十冬的朋友，無欠啥\n只欠彼塊，伊佇口袋\n[Verse]\n今仔日阿財生日，牌攏排好\n阿明共手伸入去，提出彼塊\n烏木的牌，抹油抹甲光光\n阿財看一下，目睭紅紅\n[Bridge]\n瓶仔蓋跳起來，滾落桌跤\n三个人無講話，阿財喉嚨哽去\n[Chorus]\n骨牌拍落桌，聲真響\n三十二塊，這擺攏齊\n二十冬的朋友，無欠啥\n彼塊閣轉來，阮攏佇遮\n[Outro]\n牌攏齊矣，人嘛攏佇遮\n這暗，我欲贏一擺",
